 * Maximum number of default provider bundles kept alive at once. Bundles are keyed
 * by the resolved API credential; when this limit is exceeded the least-recently-used
 * bundle is evicted (and gracefully shut down).
 */
const MAX_CACHED_BUNDLES = 32;

/**
 * Grace period before an evicted bundle's providers are shut down. Shutdown is deferred
 * so that in-flight `callApi` calls on an evicted bundle can finish first. If a call is
 * still running when the timer fires, shutdown is delayed until the call completes and
 * the timer is re-armed.
 */
